      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“On the first day of the first month set up the Tent of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Place in it the Covenant Box containing the Ten Commandments and put the curtain in front of it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bring in the table and place the equipment on it. Also bring in the lampstand and set up the lamps on it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Put the gold altar for burning incense in front of the Covenant Box and hang the curtain at the entrance of the Tent. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Put in front of the Tent the altar for burning offerings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Put the washbasin between the Tent and the altar and fill it with water. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Put up the surrounding enclosure and hang the curtain at its entrance.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Then dedicate the Tent and all its equipment by anointing it with the sacred oil, and it will be holy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Next, dedicate the altar and all its equipment by anointing it, and it will be completely holy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also dedicate the washbasin and its base in the same way.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bring Aaron and his sons to the entrance of the Tent, and tell them to take a ritual bath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dress Aaron in the priestly garments, anoint him, and in this way consecrate him, so that he can serve me as priest. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bring his sons and put the shirts on them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then anoint them, just as you anointed their father, so that they can serve me as priests. This anointing will make them priests for all time to come.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses did everything just as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So on the first day of the first month of the second year after they left Egypt, the Tent of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence was set up. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses put down its bases, set up its frames, attached its crossbars, and put up its posts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He spread out the covering over the Tent and put the outer covering over it, just as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he took the two stone tablets and put them in the Covenant Box. He put the poles in the rings of the box and put the lid on it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he put the box in the Tent and hung up the curtain. In this way he screened off the Covenant Box, just as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
