            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He put the table in the Tent, on the north side outside the curtain, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and placed on it the bread offered to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", just as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He put the lampstand in the Tent, on the south side, opposite the table, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and there in the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence he lit the lamps, just as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He put the gold altar in the Tent, in front of the curtain, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and burnt the sweet-smelling incense, just as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He hung the curtain at the entrance of the Tent, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and there in front of the curtain he placed the altar for burning offerings. On it he sacrificed the burnt offering and the grain offering, just as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He put the washbasin between the Tent and the altar and filled it with water. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses, Aaron, and his sons washed their hands and their feet there ",
